<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Lehman upgrades aluminum stocks.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Lehman upgrades aluminum stocks.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-07-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Lehman Brothers said analyst Richard Aldrich upgraded several aluminum stocks.</p>
<p>-- raised Alcan Aluminium Ltd, Aluminum Co of America, Kaiser Aluminum Corp and Reynolds Metals Co to outperform from neutral.</p>
<p>-- maintained buy on Alumax Inc.</p>
<p>-- said in summary report the aluminum ingot price is beginning to break out on the London Metals Exchange, as demand continues to grow in most regions and inventories continue to fall.  </p>
<p>-- maintained 1997 aluminum ingot price forecast of $0.75 a pound and 1998 forecast at $0.83.</p>
</text>
